ong> with different objectives that will make you change the way you play as much as the skills you choose. Those include Combat, Endless, King of the Hill, Attack, Capture...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/516890/extras/f59b640592009b3c4310848f11458133.avif?t=1497441697\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><strong>Random Global Effects</strong>, which change the general rules of each match in subtle or radical ways. The varying rules will keep the game play fresh and require you to consider the Skills you use to approach them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/516890/extras/4f2b6927303b31a984945c91a7e7802c.avif?t=1497441697\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
